        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 400.072,
        "x1": 237.92,
        "bottom": 410.072
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0056",
      "text": "supply) it is necessary to measure the bearing",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 303.636,
        "top": 403.555,
        "x1": 510.836,
        "bottom": 413.555
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0057",
      "text": "– Inject the specified amount of grease into the bearing.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 412.072,
        "x1": 283.96,
        "bottom": 422.072
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0058",
      "text": "temperature for the whole duty range and if exceeds",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 303.636,
        "top": 415.555,
        "x1": 534.066,
        "bottom": 425.555
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0059",
      "text": "– Let the motor run for 1-2 hours to ensure that all excess",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 424.072,
        "x1": 291.67,
        "bottom": 434.072
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0060",
      "text": "80°C, the lubrication intervals should be halved for a 15°C",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 303.636,
        "top": 427.555,
        "x1": 559.256,
        "bottom": 437.555
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0061",
      "text": "grease is forced out of the bearing. Close the grease",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 46.0,
        "top": 436.072,
        "x1": 277.95,
        "bottom": 446.072
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0062",
      "text": "increase in bearing temperature. If the motor is operated",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 303.636,
        "top": 439.555,
        "x1": 552.396,
        "bottom": 449.555
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0063",
      "text": "outlet plug or closing valve if fitted.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 46.0,
        "top": 448.072,
        "x1": 198.35,
        "bottom": 458.072
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0064",
      "text": "at high speeds, it is also possible to utilize so called high",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 303.636,
        "top": 451.555,
        "x1": 552.696,
        "bottom": 461.555
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0065",
      "text": "speed greases, see chapter 6.2.4.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 303.636,
        "top": 463.555,
        "x1": 454.586,
        "bottom": 473.555
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0066",
      "text": "Regreasing while the motor is at a standstill",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 468.602,
        "x1": 244.95,
        "bottom": 478.602
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0067",
      "text": "If it is not possible to regrease the bearings while the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 483.402,
        "x1": 268.74,
        "bottom": 493.402
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0068",
      "text": "motors are running, lubrication can be carried out while",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 495.402,
        "x1": 279.88,
        "bottom": 505.402
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0069",
      "text": "WARNING",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.806,
        "top": 496.085,
        "x1": 366.086,
        "bottom": 506.085
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0070",
      "text": "the machine is at a standstill.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 507.402,
        "x1": 164.39,
        "bottom": 517.402
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0071",
      "text": "The maximum operating temperature of the grease",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.806,
        "top": 508.055,
        "x1": 543.056,
        "bottom": 518.055
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0072",
      "text": "and bearings, +110°C, must not be exceeded.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.806,
        "top": 520.055,
        "x1": 520.946,
        "bottom": 530.055
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0073",
      "text": "– In this case use only half the quantity of grease and",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 522.232,
        "x1": 273.81,
        "bottom": 532.232
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0074",
      "text": "The designed maximum speed of the motor must",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.806,
        "top": 532.055,
        "x1": 534.916,
        "bottom": 542.055
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0075",
      "text": "then run the motor for a few minutes at full speed.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 46.0,
        "top": 534.232,
        "x1": 265.36,
        "bottom": 544.232
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0076",
      "text": "not be exceeded.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 317.806,
        "top": 544.055,
        "x1": 394.226,
        "bottom": 554.055
      },
      "reading_order": 76,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0077",
      "text": "– When the motor has stopped, apply the rest of the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 546.232,
        "x1": 267.79,
        "bottom": 556.232
      },
      "reading_order": 77,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0078",
      "text": "specified amount of grease to the bearing.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 46.0,
        "top": 558.232,
        "x1": 232.82,
        "bottom": 568.232
      },
      "reading_order": 78,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0079",
      "text": "– After 1-2 running hours close the grease outlet plug or",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.0,
        "top": 570.232,
        "x1": 285.06,
        "bottom": 580.232
      },
      "reading_order": 79,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0080",
      "text": "closing valve if fitted.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 46.0,
        "top": 582.232,
        "x1": 137.76,
        "bottom": 592.232
      },
      "reading_order": 80,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0081",
      "text": "EN-15",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 530.936,
        "top": 797.386,
        "x1": 559.276,
        "bottom": 807.386
      },
      "reading_order": 81,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP019:p0015:b0082",
      "text": "ABB/Manual for Low Voltage Motors 01-2009",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 36.142,
        "top": 799.746,
        "x1": 218.671,
        "bottom": 808.746
      },
      "reading_order": 82,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    }
